   1656  f3cb							; Snake patrol: bounds are SYMMETRIC about the ROM spawn X (± SNAKE_PATROL =
   1657  f3cb							; one tile, user 2026-10-19 — see the constant): retreat a tile behind the
   1658  f3cb							; placement, come out a tile, repeat. The ROM dir names the side it comes OUT
   1659  f3cb							; on: the loader inverts a snake's live dir at room load (bank2 EnterRoomB2),
   1660  f3cb							; so the first move is the retreat into its wall. Ignores editor range_* per
   1661  f3cb							; user 2026-09-23. No wall collision.
