   2681  f804							; SOSkipTail — the rotation slot picked a DEAD enemy (or a taken key). It used
   2682  f804							; to draw nothing, so the survivor showed only every 2nd frame: kill the enemy
   2683  f804							; next to the miner and the MINER started flickering (user 2026-10-25), and a
   2684  f804							; two-enemy room flickered its survivor. Hand the slot on instead:
   2685  f804							;   1. the miner is here -> draw the miner (every frame once the enemy is gone);
