   2873  f8eb							; PlayerHitsMap — check player bounding box against the room's PF map
   2874  f8eb							; ==============================================================================
   2875  f8eb							; Boxes are in tile coordinates (col 0-19, row 0-2); the walk tests the
   2876  f8eb							; PF0/1/2Buf cell bits directly (cell_collision_plan 2.1) — no rect cache,
   2877  f8eb							; no rect-count limit. The playfield is reflected, so right-half display
   2878  f8eb							; cols mirror via 39-col IN THE PROLOGUE (walk sees left-half only).
   2879  f8eb							; Returns C=0 if clear, C=1 if blocked.
   2880  f8eb				   PlayerHitsMap
   2881  f8eb							; --- Tile row range (top, bottom) ---
