   3010  f97a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3011  f97a							; RefreshEnemyY moved post-pad (after TitleWork) — 2026-10-02, so its SELECT
   3012  f97a							; → title check costs 0 pre-pad bytes (headroom 1B). Pins .ds $FBF8/$FC49
