   3379  fbe8							; 2026-10-28 (flicker): extra passes are GOVERNED by the overscan timer. A pass starts
   3380  fbe8							; only while INTIM >= UE_MIN_INTIM (pass ~250c + the tail work after UpdateEnemies);
   3381  fbe8							; otherwise it is dropped, so a frame that already spent its time on 3 PlayerHitsMap
   3382  fbe8							; calls does not overrun into 273+ lines. The first pass always runs. EnemySpd is
   3383  fbe8							; never 0 here (LoadLevel sets it; sim_frame_budget asserts it), so the old `bmi`
   3384  fbe8							; guard went to make room. An expired timer reads as a wrapped INTIM (>= $80 for
   3385  fbe8							; 127c): that is NOT "enough" - 2026-11-14: it used to count as enough, so a frame that had
   3386  fbe8							; already overrun started another pass and ran 304 lines (the A/B room-bank stubs cost ~100c
   3387  fbe8							; per frame; two heavy laser-kill rooms crossed the edge). `bmi` drops the pass instead.
