   3645  fca1							; LoseLifeBand — life path + respawn just above the water strip.
   3646  fca1							; The shift MUST happen BEFORE LoseLife: its stay path tail-jumps DropArm,
   3647  fca1							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3648  fca1							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3649  fca1							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
