   3651  fca1							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 115), so 115 -> 103 clears the strip.
   3652  fca1							; Tail-jmps LoseLife (never returns here): its exhausted path rts straight to
   3653  fca1							; CheckBandTouch.
