   3776  fd24							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3777  fd24							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   3778  fd24							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   3779  fd24							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   3780  fd24							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   3781  fd24							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   3782  fd24							; Joystick (2026-11): UP = SELECT, DOWN = level-1, FIRE = RESET (bank1 TitleSelect).
   3783  fd24							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3784  fd24							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3785  fd24							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3786  fd24							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3787  fd24							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3788  fd24							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   3789  fd24							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3790  fd24							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3791  fd24							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3792  fd24							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
