   3841  fd62							; RefreshEnemyY — write live Y → EnemyRamY (every slot, live or dead).
   3842  fd62							; Runs at overscan entry: inside the safe window (after the HUD score-ptr
   3843  fd62							; stomp of $E2-$E4, before LaserInput / CheckEnemyHit / moth / next frame's
   3844  fd62							; SelectActiveObject read it) — see the EnemyRamY contract at the ZP map.
   3845  fd62							; E1: moving types (bat) get ROM spawn + TickCounter-derived offset via
   3846  fd62							; DeriveEnemyY — no persistent movement state exists in RAM.
   3847  fd62							; Clobbers A/X/Y. Moved post-pad 2026-10-02 (SELECT → title needs this
   3848  fd62							; block after the pads; pre-pad headroom is 1B).
