   3903  fd9d							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3904  fd9d							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3905  fd9d							;   Hot rows overwrite with the TickCounter-bit5 pulse (amber/red).
   3906  fd9d							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3907  fd9d							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
