   3910  fd9d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3911  fd9d							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3912  fd9d							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3913  fd9d							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   3914  fd9d							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3915  fd9d							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3916  fd9d							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3917  fd9d							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3918  fd9d							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3919  fd9d							;   in S3.0b.
