   3943  fdc5							; BombEnemyBlast — bank2 entry tramp ($FDD8, lamp-safe S9 2026-10-07): the
   3944  fdc5							; BombTick `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta $1FF6` switches to bank2, the `jmp`
   3945  fdc5							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3946  fdc5							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3947  fdc5							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   3948  fdc5							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   3949  fdc5							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   3950  fdc5							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
   3951  fdc5							; TWIN: bank2.asm mirrors these exact 6 bytes at $FDD8 (the pad after
   3952  fdc5							; .HOVdone). The PickPlayerFrame pin that used to absorb the size is gone
   3953  fdc5							; (retired 2026-10-20); the $FC49 / $FBF8 pins bound this block today.
