   4250  fe9c							; TallyWork — level-bonus count-up (user spec 2026-10-02): reaching the miner
   4251  fe9c							; freezes the frame (dispatch bypasses input/physics/enemies via DropTarget
   4252  fe9c							; $FE), bank2 TallyEntry adds +50 every 4 frames and writes the coin tone
   4253  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   4254  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   4255  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
   4256  fe9c							;   Tail mirrors TitleWork: UpdateBombSound holds the coin (BombSnd>0), jet
   4257  fe9c							;   muted, own INTIM wait -> StartFrame: timer block skipped = frozen scene.
   4258  fe9c							; Lives in the $FE8C LHT..moth fill (bank0 has no pre-pad headroom).
   4259  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
